#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Instaliraj {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Instaliraj {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"U spremniku ovi dijelovi aplikacije {title} neće raditi:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Datoteka .deb ne može ići u sustav. Da bi sve radilo, potražite {title} kao .rpm datoteku ili u Bazaaru, trgovini aplikacija.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: svejedno je stavlja u spremnik, bez tih dijelova."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"Dolazi iz vlastitog izvora za preuzimanje tvrtke {maker}, koji se dodaje u sustav kako bi se {title} nastavio ažurirati. Potrebni su vaša lozinka i ponovno pokretanje.\n"
"\n"
"Za povezivanje vam je potreban račun tvrtke {maker}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"Preporučeno: Dodaj u sustav. U spremniku ovi dijelovi aplikacije {title} neće raditi:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"U sustavu sve radi. Potrebni su vaša lozinka i ponovno pokretanje.\n"
"\n"
"Ili {setup}: stavlja je u zaseban spremnik. Lakše se uklanja, ali ti dijelovi neće raditi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: stavlja je u zaseban spremnik. Vaš se sustav ne mijenja, a Ukloni aplikacije čisto je uklanja."

