msgstr "To se nije moglo spremiti."

msgid "That didn't save. Try again in Wheelhouse, Network safety."
msgstr "To se nije spremilo. Pokušajte ponovno u Wheelhouseu, Sigurnost mreže."

msgid "That folder belongs to someone else."
msgstr "Ta mapa pripada nekome drugome."

msgid "That folder has no pictures in it (JPEG, PNG or WebP)."
msgstr "U toj mapi nema slika (JPEG, PNG ili WebP)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "Ta se mapa već dijeli kao {name}."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "Ta se mapa ne dijeli."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Ta mapa nije pronađena."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr ""
"Mapa s tim nazivom ne može se dijeliti. Preimenujte je ili odaberite drugu."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "To ovdje nije propušteno."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"To nije lozinka za disk, pa ništa nije promijenjeno. Pokušajte ponovno."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Previše ste puta unijeli pogrešnu lozinku za disk, pa je zaključan na sat "
"vremena. Ništa nije promijenjeno. Nakon toga pokušajte ponovno."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"Na zaslonu BIOS-a upotrebljava se tipkovnica. Kad završite, odaberite „Save "
"and Exit” (Spremi i izađi) ili „Exit” (Izađi)."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Postavka RAID u BIOS-u (Intel RST) skriva disk. Ponovno pokrenite računalo u "
"BIOS i postavite način pohrane (često nazvan SATA Mode ili SATA Operation) na"
" AHCI. Windows na ovom disku nakon te promjene neće se pokretati, ali "
"instalacija EvenKeelOS-a ionako ga briše."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Upravljački program za Bluetooth je blokiran, pa nema Bluetootha."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA kartica radi s upravljačkim programom otvorenog koda ugrađenim u "
"EvenKeelOS. Vlasnički NVIDIA upravljački program ne upotrebljava se: prečesto"
" se kvari da bi se održalo obećanje da EvenKeelOS jednostavno radi. Ako vam "
"je potreban, umjesto toga upotrijebite NVIDIA izdanja Bazzitea ili Bluefina."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr ""
"QR kod nije bilo moguće izraditi. Umjesto toga spremite zapisnik na USB "
"stick."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "USB stick nije bilo moguće otvoriti."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Popis VPN-ova nedostaje."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Upravljački program Wi-Fi kartice blokiran je, pa nema Wi-Fija."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Administratorska lozinka nije unesena, pa ništa nije promijenjeno."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Administratorska lozinka nije unesena, pa ništa nije promijenjeno."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Sustav aplikacija (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "U uputama aplikacije navedeno je TCP, UDP ili oboje"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Test automatskog vraćanja je uspio."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko ažuriranje već je u tijeku, pa ovaj prozor prati njegov napredak "
"dok se ne završi. Možete nastaviti s radom."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Baterija je na %s%%, a računalo nije priključeno na napajanje. Ako se "
"baterija isprazni tijekom ažuriranja, ažuriranje se gubi i mora početi "
"ispočetka.\\n\\nPreporučeno: Ne sada. Priključite računalo na napajanje, a "
"zatim ponovno pokrenite Ažuriranje sustava.\\n\\nIli Svejedno ažuriraj."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Baterija je na %s%%. Priključite računalo na napajanje: ako se baterija "
"isprazni tijekom ažuriranja, ažuriranje će biti izgubljeno."

